WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.618
A solo world class now starts in its world: press Start riding, and the world fades

00:00:07.618 --> 00:00:09.132
in around the class.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.483
With no bike, the world keeps loading, and the card says to wake the bike and

00:00:14.483 --> 00:00:16.242
connect it before you ride.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.851
Once the world is ready and the bike connected, Start riding turns on and takes

00:00:27.851 --> 00:00:28.502
focus.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.304
The renderer that built and warmed the world carries on in the class ride, so

00:00:40.304 --> 00:00:41.850
nothing is built twice.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.655
The class video plays in the corner with its own sound; without it, the world's own

00:00:53.655 --> 00:00:54.622
track plays.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:05.050
The class in its world, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:14.847 --> 00:01:19.252
What the tests prove: the bike gates the start, one renderer, a fade, and the

00:01:19.252 --> 00:01:20.353
world's music.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:29.774
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:30.119 --> 00:01:34.631
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:34.631 --> 00:01:36.302
every hill and interval.

00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:41.825
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:41.825 --> 00:01:47.273
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.263
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:50.608 --> 00:01:53.101
A custom workout lives under Profile.
